    ["Zhevra drop the Fresh Zhevra Carcass that draws Ishamuhale out. It spoils 30 minutes after you loot it."] = "Les zhévras droppent Carcasse de zhévra fraîche qui attire Ishamuhale. Ça se gâte 30 minutes après le loot.",
